  "prefLabel": "Csp 601.01 Purpose and Scope of Program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Csp 601.01 Purpose and Scope of Program. The New Hampshire college tuition savings plan UNIQUE annual allocation program (UAAP), has been designed as one method to fulfill the statutory obligation in RSA 6:38, to provide increased, equal access and choice for deserving, needy New Hampshire residents seeking the benefits of postsecondary education at a New Hampshire institution.\n\nSource. #7339, eff 8-3-00; ss by #8622, eff 5-4-06; ss by #9220, eff 8-1-08; ss by #11098, eff 5-17-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/csp100-700.html"
